        <mxCell id="hdr_sub" value="PK / FK / UK, PostgreSQL types, nullability, unique &amp;amp; partial-unique constraints and indexes. Edges run from the FK column to the referenced PK. Fields are exactly those in Architecture v3 §4 (automated cross-check). Composite FKs are listed in each entity footer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#666666'&gt;&lt;i&gt;Traceability: Arch v3 §4, §5, §8; SRS v3 §6; ADR-009/011/019; NFR-04, NFR-07&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
